flowchart LR
  idea([Bug, idea or follow-up]) --> record["/radin-record<br/>log entries"]
  record --> backlog[(Backlog<br/>.claude/.radin)]
  backlog --> flag{Entry flagged<br/>planning needed?}
  flag -- yes --> plan["/radin-plan<br/>write plan file"]
  plan --> backlog
  flag -- no --> run
  backlog --> run["/radin-batch or /radin-do<br/>run loop"]
  run --> commits[One commit<br/>per task]
  commits --> review["/radin-review<br/>triage findings"]
  review -- agreed findings --> record
  review --> done([Done])
